#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:3
#: 95c1c5be3e664c3081c5b69709eaf015
msgid "几何筛选（Geometry Filter）"
msgstr "Geometry Filter"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:5
#: 394d4643747f46fc99a8e4c7c11505d5
msgid "**分类：** 筛选与采样"
msgstr "**Category:** Filtering"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:7
#: 628c06bcb8a149bea72e1e297839375f
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:9
#: ff8a6b18bb11460799e40c55ed5dd76c
msgid "按明确的几何门槛清洗候选结构，只保留全部条件都通过的帧。它通常放在结构生成或扰动之后、`FPS Filter` 之前，避免明显异常结构进入代表性采样和 DFT。"
msgstr ""
"Clean a candidate set using explicit geometric thresholds and retain only frames that"
" pass every enabled condition. Place it after structure generation or perturbation "
"and before `FPS Filter`, so clearly invalid structures do not enter representative "
"sampling or DFT."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:11
#: d068940086a644be8fd0acd566aa0f26
msgid "空结构和含 NaN/Inf 坐标的结构始终删除。其余数值填 `0` 表示不启用该项。界面的“精确预览”会在后台检查完整输入，并显示保留数、删除数和每帧遇到的第一个失败原因。"
msgstr ""
"Empty structures and structures containing NaN/Inf coordinates are always removed. "
"For all other numeric thresholds, enter `0` to disable the check. The interface's "
"`Exact preview` checks the complete input in the background and reports retained and "
"removed counts plus the first failure reason encountered for each frame."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:13
#: 88ecd7027c2a4234a08566df0eaea597
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:15
#: db58af8b13ec4bce94e3d77664dad715
msgid "对含 $N$ 个原子的结构，程序计算"
msgstr "For a structure containing $N$ atoms, the program computes"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:17
#: a2e95a7fb2f043a4856bffe265b910be
msgid ""
"\n"
"d_{\\min}=\\min_{i<j}d_{ij}^{\\mathrm{MIC}},\\qquad\n"
"v_{\\mathrm{atom}}=\\frac{|\\det\\mathbf C|}{N},\\qquad\n"
"\\rho=1.66053906660\\frac{\\sum_i M_i}{|\\det\\mathbf C|}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:23
#: 4ce3ef08ee1b40e9808d1e81428228d4
msgid "$d_{ij}^{\\mathrm{MIC}}$：只在启用的周期方向使用最小镜像，单位 Å；距离严格小于下限时删除，恰好等于下限时保留。"
msgstr ""
"$d_{ij}^{\\mathrm{MIC}}$: the minimum-image convention is applied only along enabled "
"periodic directions, in Å. A structure is removed when the distance is strictly below"
" the lower bound and retained when it equals the bound."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:24
#: 40fd6c990bd74e7a90b0bf14a176bae7
msgid "$v_{\\mathrm{atom}}$：完整晶胞体积除以原子数，单位 Å³/atom。"
msgstr "$v_{\\mathrm{atom}}$: full cell volume divided by atom count, in Å³/atom."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:25
#: 3838222cb28f461aab0d91f2410c08de
msgid "$\\rho$：由完整晶胞体积和原子质量 $M_i$ 得到的质量密度，单位 g/cm³。"
msgstr ""
"$\\rho$: mass density calculated from the full cell volume and atomic masses $M_i$, "
"in g/cm³."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:27
#: 3e507aa90962485b91bb555eac302e11
msgid "体积和密度都使用整个晶胞，真空层也计入。因此 slab、界面、多孔结构或带盒子的分子只有在“完整晶胞数值”确实可比较时才适合启用这些门槛。"
msgstr ""
"Both volume and density use the entire cell, including vacuum. Therefore, enable "
"these thresholds for slabs, interfaces, porous structures, or boxed molecules only "
"when their full-cell values are genuinely comparable."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:29
#: 61e2c768601846439c478eb9d6e65b82
msgid "筛选按以下顺序记录每帧的第一个失败原因：空结构 → 非有限坐标 → 无效晶胞 → 原子对过近 → 单原子体积过小/过大 → 密度过低/过高。正式运行与预览使用同一判定。"
msgstr ""
"The filter records the first failure reason for each frame in this order: empty "
"structure → nonfinite coordinates → invalid cell → atom pair too close → per-atom "
"volume too small/large → density too low/high. The full run and preview use the same "
"criteria."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:31
#: 0153b37716ed4dd2b9c6196f1bfe19dd
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:33
#: 4e78be81828f49109bcf1b7e3a0a20da
msgid ""
"随机占位和强扰动后，候选池中出现少量过短原子对。先查看距离分布，再把“最小原子对距离”设为低于所有合理键长的下限，例如金属候选池可从 `1.0 Å` "
"附近试起。预览若只删除低端离群帧，再运行筛选并接 `FPS Filter`。"
msgstr ""
"After random occupancy and strong perturbation, a candidate pool may contain a few "
"excessively short atom pairs. Inspect the distance distribution first, then set "
"`Minimum atom-pair distance` below every physically reasonable bond length. For a "
"metallic candidate pool, a value near `1.0 Å` can be an initial trial. If the preview"
" removes only low-end outlier frames, run the filter and follow it with `FPS Filter`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:35
#: cbdb0efa76f94f07bd84ee68046ef07a
msgid "混合化学体系不能照搬这个示例：H–H、O–H 等合理短键可能小于金属体系阈值。若无法给所有元素对确定统一下限，就保持 `0`。"
msgstr ""
"Do not apply this example unchanged to mixed chemical systems: valid short bonds such"
" as H–H and O–H may be below a threshold suitable for metals. If no single lower "
"bound is valid for every element pair, keep the value at `0`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:37
#: 85bae7a30cb647bebf57bd9c9460640e
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:39
#: 7fb1cfac4d034e0899470e0643a159f5
msgid "最小原子对距离（min_pair_distance）"
msgstr "Minimum Atom-Pair Distance (min_pair_distance)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:41
#: 337525fad93e4113a766e1a410e9a894
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `0.5 Å`。所有元素对共用同一个距离下限；该值用于清除明显重叠，同时保留常见的 H–H 键。设为 `0` "
"可关闭。非周期分子即使没有有效晶胞，也可以单独使用这一项。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.5 Å`. All element pairs share one distance lower bound. The "
"default removes clear overlaps while retaining a typical H–H bond. Set it to `0` to "
"disable the check. This check can be used by itself for a nonperiodic molecule even "
"when no valid cell is present."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:43
#: 49c6f58cec7a458abf56834943ad8f7b
msgid "最小单原子体积（min_volume_per_atom）"
msgstr "min_volume_per_atom"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:45
#: eafcfbc7410442b4bf081959f148532f
msgid "`float`，默认 `0 Å³/atom`。删除单原子体积低于该值的结构；`0` 表示关闭。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0 Å³/atom`. Removes structures whose per-atom volume is below this "
"value; `0` disables the check."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:47
#: b2a16fec2cd64e79873d80292623782f
msgid "最大单原子体积（max_volume_per_atom）"
msgstr "max_volume_per_atom"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:49
#: 246765181f9d4944b480312db1395b6f
msgid "`float`，默认 `0 Å³/atom`。删除单原子体积高于该值的结构；`0` 表示关闭。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0 Å³/atom`. Removes structures whose per-atom volume is above this "
"value; `0` disables the check."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:51
#: 91af640bf3324022af76b8b78cdf6c7f
msgid "最小密度（min_density）"
msgstr "min_density"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:53
#: 670984902c6a4d0c9fc2920ec2b40562
msgid "`float`，默认 `0 g/cm³`。删除密度低于该值的结构；`0` 表示关闭。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0 g/cm³`. Removes structures whose density is below this value; `0`"
" disables the check."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:55
#: 227b8ff6bd0f4af4a2e3321cdd9d9136
msgid "最大密度（max_density）"
msgstr "max_density"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:57
#: b0d69dbfb59049e4be8f1661e42b5437
msgid "`float`，默认 `0 g/cm³`。删除密度高于该值的结构；`0` 表示关闭。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0 g/cm³`. Removes structures whose density is above this value; `0`"
" disables the check."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:59
#: 35ac774892f148c8b33378f995c159b3
msgid "删除无效晶胞（require_finite_cell）"
msgstr "Remove Invalid Cells (require_finite_cell)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:61
#: 141bec6645534767b7045bcde3e3875d
msgid "`bool`，默认 `false`。开启后删除含 NaN/Inf、奇异或近零体积的晶胞。只要启用了任一体积或密度门槛，无效晶胞也会自动删除。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. When enabled, removes cells containing NaN/Inf values or "
"having singular or near-zero volume. Invalid cells are also removed automatically "
"whenever any volume or density threshold is enabled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:63
#: dd4b8cf1894542a8bf5a5a789d8ee805
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:65
#: 8f02997e50824b748066d711508340fe
msgid "`Atomic Perturb → Geometry Filter → FPS Filter`"
msgstr "`Atomic Perturb → Geometry Filter → FPS Filter`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:66
#: ac35b8b3d53c493494c769addb79e4f9
msgid "`Random Occupancy → Geometry Filter → FPS Filter`"
msgstr "`Random Occupancy → Geometry Filter → FPS Filter`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:68
#: 521a77343a6d48368e0e27834a0e1693
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:70
#: 89860a67893d48f1994e2bc0d7c29904
msgid "**为什么预览的各原因之和等于删除总数？** 每帧只计入第一个失败原因，不会在多个原因中重复计数。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the sum of preview reasons equal the total removed count?** Each frame is "
"counted under its first failure reason only and is not duplicated across reasons."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:72
#: 93b8f5626318488fa3e24f5c4df7267a
msgid "**为什么 slab 的密度很低？** 真空层属于完整晶胞体积，会降低密度并增大单原子体积。此类数据通常只开原子对距离门槛。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is a slab's density low?** Vacuum is part of the full cell volume, which lowers"
" density and raises per-atom volume. For such data, usually enable only the atom-pair"
" distance threshold."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:74
#: e305f8d8fa0c4a61854e7d631d59b459
msgid "**为什么无晶胞分子仍能检查距离？** 只开原子对距离时不要求有效晶胞；周期最小镜像仅用于结构实际启用的周期方向。"
msgstr ""
"**Why can a molecule without a cell still be checked for distance?** A valid cell is "
"not required when only the atom-pair distance check is enabled. Periodic minimum "
"images are used only along directions in which the structure actually enables PBC."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:76
#: d452e42dd674422ea4ad1c36e641b6b6
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:78
#: 530ab64d84b1469985bd32b54fdd9e5a
msgid "保留下来的结构及其 `Config_type` 不变，输入顺序也不变。"
msgstr ""
"Retained structures and their `Config_type` values remain unchanged, as does the "
"input order."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:80
#: d495b8afc7584a9f96dddaeed4a070e1
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:82
#: 394a89f49a324986bfcca58fa18bf069
msgid "本卡没有随机性。同一输入和同一参数会得到相同结果。"
msgstr "This card has no randomness. The same input and parameters produce the same result."

#~ msgid "几何过滤（Geometry Filter）"
#~ msgstr "Geometry Filter"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Geometry Filter` 按显式阈值过滤候选结构：最短原子间距、单原子体积、质量密度和有限晶胞。它不计算能量，不修复结构，也不替代"
#~ " `FPS Filter`。它的职责是在代表性采样和 DFT 前挡掉几何上已经明显不可用的结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Geometry Filter` rejects candidates using explicit"
#~ " thresholds for minimum pair distance, volume "
#~ "per atom, mass density, and finite cell "
#~ "volume. It computes no energy, repairs "
#~ "nothing, and does not replace `FPS Filter`."
#~ " Use it before representative sampling and "
#~ "DFT to remove geometry that is already "
#~ "clearly unusable."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输入：** 已生成的候选结构池。 **目标：** 在 FPS 前删除短键和异常体积结构。 "
#~ "**参数设置：** "
#~ "`min_pair_distance=1.2`，`min_volume_per_atom=5.0`，`max_volume_per_atom=40.0`，密度阈值保持关闭。"
#~ " **输出：** 只保留满足所有开启阈值的结构。 **怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 导入 `NEP "
#~ "Dataset Display` 后，最短键分布不再有低端离群点；FPS 选出的结构不应再包含明显重叠帧。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Input:** A generated candidate pool. "
#~ "**Objective:** Remove short-bond and abnormal-"
#~ "volume structures before FPS. **Parameters:** "
#~ "`min_pair_distance=1.2`, `min_volume_per_atom=5.0`, "
#~ "`max_volume_per_atom=40.0`, with density checks disabled."
#~ " **Output:** Only structures satisfying every "
#~ "enabled threshold. **Verification:** The nearest-"
#~ "distance distribution in `NEP Dataset Display` "
#~ "should have no low-end outliers, and FPS"
#~ " output should contain no obvious overlaps."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 1.0 "
#~ "Å。任意原子对允许的最近距离，硬短键门槛。应低于你目标体系的正常最近邻键长，但远高于原子明显重叠的距离——金属/氧化物通常从 1.0~1.5 "
#~ "Å 起步。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `1.0` Å. Hard lower bound "
#~ "for every pair distance. Set it below "
#~ "normal nearest-neighbor distances but safely "
#~ "above obvious overlap; 1.0-1.5 Å is a "
#~ "common starting band for metals and oxides,"
#~ " subject to the actual chemistry."

#~ msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后零体积 cell 的结构直接删除。晶体、slab、界面候选池建议开；孤立分子或非周期构型关掉。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default `false`. Reject zero-volume "
#~ "cells. Enable for crystal, slab, and interface"
#~ " pools; disable for isolated molecules or "
#~ "nonperiodic configurations."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**非周期分子被删掉。** 如果开启了体积、密度或 `require_finite_cell`，零体积分子会被删除。分子构象清洗通常只开"
#~ " `min_pair_distance`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**A nonperiodic molecule was removed.** Volume, "
#~ "density, or `require_finite_cell` checks reject "
#~ "zero-volume molecular cells. For molecular "
#~ "conformers, normally enable only `min_pair_distance`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Geometry Filter` 按显式阈值过滤候选结构：最短原子间距、单原子体积、质量密度和有效晶胞。它不计算能量，不修复结构，也不替代"
#~ " `FPS Filter`。它的职责是在代表性采样和 DFT 前挡掉几何上已经明显不可用的结构。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "空结构和含 NaN/Inf 坐标的结构始终被删除。其他阈值默认关闭，避免用一个通用数值误删含氢分子、slab 或带真空结构。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "短距离检查会把整批结构交给原生邻居扫描一次完成；原生扩展不可用或遇到合法的奇异部分周期晶胞时，自动使用同一距离语义的 Python "
#~ "fallback。这个加速只改变响应时间，不改变阈值和筛选结果。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "卡片中的保留/删除数量预览在后台计算，不会占用界面事件循环。连续调整参数时，中间请求会被合并，界面只采用最新参数对应的结果；正式运行仍会重新按当前参数处理完整输入。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\n"
#~ "d_{\\min}=\\min_{i<j}d_{ij}^{\\mathrm{MIC}},\\qquad\n"
#~ "v_{\\mathrm{atom}}=\\frac{|\\det\\mathbf C|}{N},\\qquad\n"
#~ "\\rho=1.66053906660\\,\\frac{\\sum_i M_i}{|\\det\\mathbf C|}.\n"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "$d_{ij}^{\\mathrm{MIC}}$ 是按周期边界最小镜像得到的距离，单位 Å； "
#~ "$v_{\\mathrm{atom}}$ 的单位是 Å³/atom；原子质量 $M_i$ 用 "
#~ "u，换算后的 $\\rho$ 为 g/cm³。所有已开启的上下限必须**同时满足**才保留结构。阈值为 0 "
#~ "表示关闭对应 检查；空结构、非有限坐标，以及被已开启晶胞相关检查命中的无效晶胞会被拒绝。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "场景：随机占位和强扰动后出现短键结构"
#~ msgstr "Scenario: Short bonds after random occupation and strong perturbation"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "合金候选池经过 `Random Occupancy → Atomic Perturb` "
#~ "后，少量结构出现 < 1.0 Å 的原子重叠。它们进入 DFT 会浪费队列，进入 "
#~ "FPS 会污染 descriptor 空间。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "After `Random Occupancy -> Atomic Perturb`, a"
#~ " few alloy candidates contain atom pairs "
#~ "below 1.0 Å. Sending them to DFT wastes"
#~ " jobs, while including them in FPS "
#~ "contaminates descriptor space."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输入：** 已生成的候选结构池。 **目标：** 在 FPS 前删除短键和异常体积结构。 "
#~ "**参数设置：** `允许的最短原子对距离`填 `1.2 Å`，`最小单原子体积`填 `5.0 "
#~ "Å³/atom`，`最大单原子体积`填 `40.0 Å³/atom`，密度阈值保持关闭。 **输出：** "
#~ "只保留满足所有开启阈值的结构。 **怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 导入 `NEP Dataset "
#~ "Display` 后，最短键分布不再有低端离群点；FPS 选出的结构不应再包含明显重叠帧。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 0 Å（关闭）。任意原子对允许的最近距离，是与元素种类无关的硬门槛。周期方向使用最小镜像距离，非周期分子即使没有晶胞也可以只做此项检查。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "阈值应低于候选池中所有合理键长。不要把金属体系常用的 1.0~1.5 Å 直接用于含 H–H、O–H 或其他短键的混合数据集；这张卡不会根据共价半径自动调整阈值。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 0.0（关闭）。允许的最小单原子体积，过滤过度压缩的结构。阈值应来自同材料平衡体积的下界。多孔、slab "
#~ "或含真空的体系不要随便打开，开了反而误删合理结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `0.0` (disabled). Minimum volume"
#~ " per atom for rejecting overcompressed cells. "
#~ "Derive it from the material's volume range."
#~ " Avoid it for porous, slab, or vacuum-"
#~ "containing systems where it can reject valid"
#~ " structures."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 0.0（关闭）。允许的最大单原子体积，过滤过度拉伸或异常大 cell。体相候选池可以设一个合理上界；slab/分子体系有真空时这个阈值容易误杀。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `0.0` (disabled). Maximum volume"
#~ " per atom for rejecting expanded or "
#~ "abnormal cells. A bulk pool may use a"
#~ " justified bound; slabs and molecular cells "
#~ "with vacuum generally should not."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 0.0（关闭）。按质量密度过滤低密度异常结构。只在体相或近体相候选池打开；含真空、孔洞或表面模型应保持 0。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `0.0` (disabled). Minimum mass "
#~ "density. Enable only for bulk-like pools; "
#~ "keep zero for vacuum, pores, or surfaces."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 0.0（关闭）。按质量密度过滤过度压缩的结构。阈值应参考该材料的真实密度上界，不要跨元素体系套同一个数字。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `0.0` (disabled). Maximum mass "
#~ "density for rejecting overcompressed structures. Use"
#~ " a material-specific physical upper bound, "
#~ "not one value across chemical systems."

#~ msgid ""
